    real screenshot (unlike every other gate in this file, which has a
    "confirmed live: dimmed point read (R,G,B)" note) - it was copied by
    analogy from find_orange_x_button()'s gate. Checked against a real
    live screenshot (mg_live_screen.png) 2026-09-15: this screen does NOT
    dim the existing UI, it REPLACES the top bar entirely with different
