    could never recognize this screen at all, so it fell through to
    cmd_roll()'s empty-pill check (this screen occludes the roll pill too)
    and entered the full ROLL_EMPTY_BACKOFF_S backoff instead - confirmed
    live 2026-09-15 (user report: loop was sitting in a 7200s backoff on
    this exact screen). This also means the "5 techniques failed" manual-
    only conclusion in RULES.md was drawn from taps issued directly at the
    crates from outside this script (diagnostic-only), never from this
    detector actually firing and dispatching a real tap - see
    cmd_pick_a_box() below for the follow-up finding that overturns that
